    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d71">

                <pb facs="0065" n="61" sameAs="frus:frus1938v03/pg61"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.0146/625</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Department of State to
                        the British Embassy</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aide-Mémoire</hi></p>
                <p>The Department refers to the last paragraph of the British Embassy’s <hi
                        rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> of January 26 on the subject of
                    withdrawal of diplomatic and military establishments in north China, to the
                    Department’s <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> of January 29 on the same
                    subject, and to previous recent exchanges of communications on the same
                    subject.</p>
                <p>The Department requests that the British Embassy ask the British Foreign Office
                    to be so good as to inform the French Government of the contents of the
                    Department’s <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> of January 29 and to
                    discuss with the French Government questions of reciprocal interest to the
                    British and the French Governments in the light of that communication from the
                    American Government to the British Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1938-01-31">January 31,
                            1938</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
